{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"苏轼·major-works","stage":"DONE","category":"su-shi","categoryLabel":"苏轼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/26_su-shi/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"苏轼-主要著作\">苏轼·主要著作</h1><p>本 hub 以&quot;作品&quot;为单位，精读苏轼诗词、散文、书法、绘画各领域的代表作——它回答的是&quot;苏轼到底写了/画了什么、好在哪里&quot;，而非生平、思想或影响的概览。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub（主要著作）：聚焦<strong>具体文本与作品本身</strong>——《赤壁赋》《念奴娇》《寒食帖》《木石图》的内容、艺术、系年与地位。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>：从<strong>文体革新与文学史地位</strong>的高度论苏轼（如&quot;以诗为词&quot;、唐宋八大家），是本 hub 的理论背景。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>：论支撑这些作品的<strong>人生哲学与艺术观</strong>（三教融通、尚意、重神轻形）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>：提供作品的<strong>创作语境</strong>（乌台诗案、贬黄州/惠州/儋州）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a> 与 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>：论作品<strong>之后</strong>的传播、地位与历史评价。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>简言之：本 hub 讲&quot;作品是什么&quot;，兄弟 hub 分别讲它的&quot;背景、思想、文学史定位与后世回响&quot;。各篇已用相对路径交叉链接，避免重复展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[&quot;生平·乌台诗案&lt;br/&gt;(前置背景)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;赤壁赋&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;千古名词&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;散文名篇&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;书信与杂著&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;寒食帖&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;墨竹与文人画&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n  A[\"生平·乌台诗案&lt;br/&gt;(前置背景)\"] --&gt; B[\"赤壁赋\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"千古名词\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"散文名篇\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"书信与杂著\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"寒食帖\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"墨竹与文人画\"]</pre><ol>\n<li><strong>前置（可选）</strong>：先读 <a href=\"../life-and-times/a-career-of-exile/the-wutai-poetry-case\">乌台诗案</a> 与 <a href=\"../life-and-times/a-career-of-exile/huangzhou-and-beyond\">黄州及以后</a>，因为本 hub 多数杰作都诞生于黄州贬所。</li>\n<li><strong>文学（核心）</strong>：<a href=\"poetry-and-ci/the-red-cliff-rhapsodies\">赤壁赋</a> → <a href=\"poetry-and-ci/famous-ci-poems\">千古名词</a> → <a href=\"prose-masterpieces/essays-and-records\">散文名篇</a> → <a href=\"prose-masterpieces/letters-and-inscriptions\">书信与杂著</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>艺术</strong>：<a href=\"calligraphy-and-painting/the-cold-food-observance\">寒食帖</a>（书法）→ <a href=\"calligraphy-and-painting/bamboo-and-ink\">墨竹与文人画</a>（绘画）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"章节一览\">章节一览</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>篇目</th>\n<th>覆盖作品</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"poetry-and-ci/\">诗词曲</a></td>\n<td>赤壁赋 / 千古名词</td>\n<td>前后《赤壁赋》、念奴娇、水调歌头、江城子、定风波</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"prose-masterpieces/\">散文名篇</a></td>\n<td>散文名篇 / 书信与杂著</td>\n<td>留侯论、石钟山记、记承天寺夜游、尺牍、题跋、东坡志林</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"calligraphy-and-painting/\">书法与绘画</a></td>\n<td>寒食帖 / 墨竹与文人画</td>\n<td>黄州寒食诗帖、木石图、潇湘竹石图、画论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些作品横跨诗、词、赋、散文、书、画六个领域，共同呈现苏轼作为旷世全才的辉煌成就。整体定位可回到 <a href=\"../core-contributions/a-towering-man-of-letters/the-universal-genius\">一代文宗</a>。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"poetry-and-ci","title":"Poetry And Ci","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/poetry-and-ci","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-red-cliff-rhapsodies","title":"赤壁赋","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/poetry-and-ci/the-red-cliff-rhapsodies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"famous-ci-poems","title":"千古名词","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/poetry-and-ci/famous-ci-poems"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"prose-masterpieces","title":"Prose Masterpieces","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/prose-masterpieces","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"essays-and-records","title":"散文名篇","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/prose-masterpieces/essays-and-records"},{"seq":2,"slug":"letters-and-inscriptions","title":"书信与杂著","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/prose-masterpieces/letters-and-inscriptions"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"calligraphy-and-painting","title":"Calligraphy And Painting","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/calligraphy-and-painting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-cold-food-observance","title":"寒食帖","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/calligraphy-and-painting/the-cold-food-observance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bamboo-and-ink","title":"墨竹与文人画","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/su-shi/major-works/calligraphy-and-painting/bamboo-and-ink"}]}]}